{"id":"sermon","lemma":"sermon","pos":"noun","rank":4855,"glosses":["sermon (religious speech)","sermon, lecture (lengthy reproval)"],"ipa":"/sɛʁ.mɔ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/35/Fr-sermon.ogg/Fr-sermon.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"sermons"},"formAudio":{"sermons":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/76/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-sermons.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Le sermon était terriblement long.","en":"The sermon was awfully long.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"terribly"},{"g":"long"}]},{"text":"Ses sermons sont très longs.","en":"His lectures are very long.","words":[{"g":"his"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"very"},{"g":"long","l":"long"}]},{"text":"Notre prédicateur donne le même sermon à chaque Noël.","en":"Our preacher preaches the same sermon every Christmas.","words":[{"g":"our"},{"g":"preacher"},{"g":"to give","l":"donner"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"same"},null,{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"each"},{"g":"Christmas"}]},{"text":"Vous vous êtes assoupi, à certains moments au long de mon sermon.","en":"You were nodding off at times during my lecture.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"drowsing, half-asleep"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"certain, guaranteed","l":"certain"},{"g":"moment","l":"moment"},null,null,null,{"g":"my"},null],"phrases":[[7,10,"during"]]},{"text":"Aucun pécheur n'est jamais sauvé après les vingt premières minutes d'un sermon.","en":"No sinner is ever saved after the first twenty minutes of a sermon.","words":[{"g":"none, no-one"},{"g":"sinning"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"never"},{"g":"to save, rescue","l":"sauver"},{"g":"after"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"twenty"},{"g":"first","l":"premier"},{"g":"minute","l":"minute"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"a"},null]}]}